# Replaying the journal

## Component App
State:
    Let n be 0.
Actions:
    To bump:
        Set n to n + 1.
View:
    <p id="n">{n}</p><button id="b" on-click={bump}>+</button>

## Test: replay runs the named actions
    Mount App.
    Replay these actions: bump, bump.
    Expect that the text of "#n" is equal to "2".
